WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.375
Some blocks wait. They run only when something happens: an event.

2
00:00:05.376 --> 00:00:09.351
on button A pressed runs its blocks every time A is pressed.

3
00:00:10.481 --> 00:00:14.981
on start runs once, at the start. forever runs again and again.

4
00:00:17.864 --> 00:00:22.014
Event blocks, like on shake, run each time that thing happens.
